    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32546" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπαγλ-έομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be struck with amazement, to wonder greatly,</i>
			only used in part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καί μιν ἐπεδείκνυσαν ἐκπαγλεόμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.181
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				8.92
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπαγλεομένων ὡς..</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					9.48
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>wonder at, admire exceedingly,</i> c. acc., <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				217
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				890
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tr.</u>
				929
			</span></i> ; rarein Prose, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				1.40
			</span></i>.</div>
